[00:00.50]Stay awake, stand firm, grow mighty,
[00:15.16]Be determined to endure.
[00:25.63]Carry on with manly courage,
[00:37.67]For the victory is sure.
[00:47.62]We obey Christ Jesus’ clear command;
[00:52.36]Under him we firmly take our stand.
[00:57.27](Chorus)
[00:57.42]Stay awake, stand firm, and grow mighty!
[01:01.72]Carry on right to the end!
[01:07.24]Stay awake, and keep your senses,
[01:21.80]Always ready to obey.
[01:25.98]Stay alert to Christ’s direction
[01:29.64]Through his faithful slave today.
[01:35.03]Heed the counsel of the older men,
[01:39.12]Who protect his sheep and truth defend.
[01:44.26](Chorus)
[01:44.41]Stay awake, stand firm, and grow mighty!
[01:48.86]Carry on right to the end!
[01:52.30]Stay awake, remain united
[02:08.56]As the good news we defend.
[02:12.94]Though our enemies will fight it,
[02:17.02]We will preach until the end.
[02:21.76]Join the shout of praise throughout the land.
[02:26.06]Look! Jehovah’s day is soon at hand!
[02:31.01](Chorus)
[02:31.16]Stay awake, stand firm, and grow mighty!
[02:35.97]Carry on right to the end!
